          "script": "\t# implement your handler here\n\tdb \u003d self.view.custom.dbConnection\n\ttable \u003d mes_core.model.productcodeTable(db)\n\tfilter \u003d self.view.custom.filter\n\t\n\tif filter \u003d\u003d None or filter \u003d\u003d \u0027\u0027:\n\t\tself.view.custom.tableData \u003d table.selectAll()\n\telse:\n\t\tcolumns \u003d None\n\t\twhere_clause\u003d\"ProductCode LIKE ? or Description LIKE ?\"\n\t\twhere_args \u003d [\"%\" + filter + \"%\", \"%\" + filter + \"%\"]\n\t\t#where_args \u003d [filter , filter]\n\t\tself.view.custom.tableData \u003d table.selectCustom(columns,where_clause,where_args)\n",
